# 选择 HTTP Client 的 local 环境。以下 ID 1、2、3 来自全新数据库的 V2 演示号源。
# 重复运行前先查询可用号源并替换 scheduleId；已有 BOOKED 号源不能再提交。
# 先运行 auth.http 中的注册和登录，得到 accessToken。

### 查询医院
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hospitals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询医院 1 的科室
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hospitals/1/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询科室 1 的医生（包含 doctorNo）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments/1/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询医生 1 尚未开诊且可用的号源
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 路径 A：创建预约并保留号源 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "1"
}

> {%
client.global.set("paidAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
client.global.set("paidPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
%}

### A：查看凭证、支付截止时间和 canPay/canCancel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A：在截止前模拟支付
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paidPaymentId}}/simulate-success
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A：重复支付仍返回成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paidPaymentId}}/simulate-success
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A：支付后凭证仍完整，状态为 CONFIRMED + PAID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 路径 B：创建另一笔待支付预约，使用号源 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "2"
}

> {%
client.global.set("cancelAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
client.global.set("cancelPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
%}

### B：截止前取消，状态为 CANCELLED + CLOSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{cancelAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### B：重复取消返回相同终态，不再释放号源
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{cancelAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### B：取消后的支付请求返回 409 / ORDER_STATE_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{cancelPaymentId}}/simulate-success
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### B：确认号源 2 重新出现在列表中；此时也可换另一用户登录后预约
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### B：再次预约号源 2，生成一张新的预约单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "2"
}

### 路径 C：查询医生 2 的号源后，用号源 3 演示超时
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/2/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### C：创建预约，记录 paymentExpiresAt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "3"
}

> {%
client.global.set("expiringAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
client.global.set("expiringPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
%}

# 等到上述 paymentExpiresAt 之后再执行后面的请求。支付会立即拒绝；
# 默认扫描每 30 秒运行一次，关闭时间在故障或积压时可能更晚。

### C：到期支付返回 409 / PAYMENT_EXPIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{expiringPaymentId}}/simulate-success
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### C：扫描关闭后查看 EXPIRED + CLOSED、closedAt 和原凭证
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{expiringAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询我的预约：全部状态保留凭证，按预约 ID 倒序
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
